.TH "bead schema list" 1  "bead schema list " 
.SH NAME
bead schema list \- List public schemas
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbead schema list\fR [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List every supported public document schema as deterministic JSON.
.PP
Entries are sorted by exact schema identity and include document kind, readability, writability, validation support, and consuming or emitting operations.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR [default: json]
Output format
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
json
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
